WEBVTT

00:00:29.958 --> 00:00:31.601
erased,

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:33.667
shrouding them in mystery.

00:00:35.417 --> 00:00:39.125
It seems like people could not
have possibly built these things,

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:41.875
because people didn't.

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:47.101
They were carefully crafted
by a primordial race of giants

00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:48.393
known as Cyclops.

00:00:48.417 --> 00:00:49.726
(Laughter)

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:51.976
And I've been collaborating
with these monsters

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.250
to learn their secrets
for moving those massive stones.

00:00:56.667 --> 00:01:00.167
And as it turns out,
Cyclops aren't even that strong.